
========================================================================
  THE BURNSIDE FORMULA AND PRIMES
========================================================================

  The Burnside formula for T_n:

  T_n = (1/n!) * sum_{sigma with all odd cycles} 2^{pair_orbits(sigma)}

  n=3: T_n = 2
    (1, 1, 1): 1 perms, Fix_sum=8, primes={1}
    (3,): 2 perms, Fix_sum=4, primes=[3]

  n=4: T_n = 4
    (1, 1, 1, 1): 1 perms, Fix_sum=64, primes={1}
    (1, 3): 8 perms, Fix_sum=32, primes=[3]

  n=5: T_n = 12
    (1, 1, 1, 1, 1): 1 perms, Fix_sum=1024, primes={1}
    (1, 1, 3): 20 perms, Fix_sum=320, primes=[3]
    (5,): 24 perms, Fix_sum=96, primes=[5]

  n=6: T_n = 56
    (1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1): 1 perms, Fix_sum=32768, primes={1}
    (1, 1, 1, 3): 40 perms, Fix_sum=5120, primes=[3]
    (1, 5): 144 perms, Fix_sum=1152, primes=[5]
    (3, 3): 40 perms, Fix_sum=1280, primes=[3]


